{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>For he will not bear your transgression, for My name is within him.</b> Even though My name is within him — he will not bear your transgression. A parallel: וסלחת לעוני כי רב הוא; כי מנשה הבכיר; כי מלאו מחשכי ארץ." "<b>For My name is within him.</b> He is authorized to say 'אני ה׳‎.' He is Metatron, whose name is like the name of his Master ה׳‎, but he is called 'the lesser ה׳‎.' And so the liturgical poet established in the hymn 'אל נא' that they recite in the land of Ashkenaz on Rosh HaShanah."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:00:04.827355497Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}